OL,3,GNEWSAMan, 28, dies after being stabbed
OL,4,Ain Clerkenwell
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 28-year-old man has died after being
OL,7,Fstabbed in central London.
OL,9,FThe Met Police and the London Ambulance
OL,10,FService were called to Lloyd Baker
OL,11,FStreet, Clerkenwell at about 23:20 BST
OL,12,Fon Wednesday following reports of a
OL,13,Fknife attack.
OL,15,FThe victim was found with stab wounds
OL,16,Fand taken to hospital, but he died from
OL,17,Fhis injuries the next day. His family
OL,18,Fhas been informed and are being
OL,19,Fsupported, the Met said.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
