OL,3,GNEWSAMan, 28, dies after being stabbed
OL,4,Ain Clerkenwell
OL,5,
OL,6,FA murder investigation has been opened
OL,7,Fand police were granted special stop
OL,8,Fand search powers in the area following
OL,9,Fthe incident, but no arrests have yet
OL,10,Fbeen made.
